  "story": {
    "day": 149,
    "title": "Kaya's Busy Evening",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya felt tired and warm, but not sick.",
      "She thought sadly of an absent friend.",
      "Mom told her to boil an onion for soup.",
      "\"Add one tablespoon of sugar,\" Mom said.",
      "Kaya quickly added soy sauce and seasoning.",
      "Finally, she ate it, thinking of a camp journey.",
      "She felt scared of wolves on a rainy, snowy climb.",
      "Her neighbor, age forty, gave attention.",
      "Kaya hoped to sell lemonade at an amusement park.",
      "She needed money to make a million yen; it was important.",
      "She had one minute to research public transport for the day after tomorrow.",
      "Kaya laughed. She would photograph her fun, take off shoes, skip one ounce of sake."
    ]
  }
